# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# EmailJS — powers the contact form (free plan works fine).
# 1. Create a free account at https://www.emailjs.com
# 2. Add an Email Service (e.g. Gmail) -> copy the Service ID
# 3. Create an Email Template with these variables:
#      {{from_name}} {{business_name}} {{reply_to}} {{phone}} {{service}} {{message}}
#    -> copy the Template ID
# 4. Account -> API Keys -> copy your Public Key
# 5. Copy this file to ".env.local" and paste your values below.
#
# Until these are set, the contact form falls back to opening the
# visitor's email app pre-filled — so the site still works.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
NEXT_PUBLIC_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=your_service_id
NEXT_PUBLIC_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=your_template_id
NEXT_PUBLIC_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=your_public_key
